  IG Windkraft                      https://www.igwindkraft.at
  APG / ONIP (transmission grid)    https://www.apg.at
  Austro Control (obstacle data)    https://www.austrocontrol.at
  BEV Kataster (INSPIRE)            https://www.bev.gv.at
